@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "About";
}

<section class="page-head">
    <div class="wrap">
        <h1>About Blue Crane</h1>
        <p class="lead">We started in a single-car garage in Hatfield with a 1kg roaster and a long list of opinions about coffee.</p>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="wrap about-wrap">
    <div class="about-grid">
        <div>
            <h2>Why we roast the way we do</h2>
            <p>Coffee is a fruit. We try to taste that fruit in the cup, so we roast lighter than most and stop well before bitterness arrives.</p>
            <p>Every coffee gets a name, a farm and a story. When a harvest ends, so does that coffee. Next season brings something new.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
            <h2>The people</h2>
            <p>Our team of nine roasts, packs, brews and delivers. If you email us, a real person who has tasted the coffee will answer.</p>
            <p>Blue cranes are South Africa's national bird: graceful, loyal and a little bit stubborn. That sounds about right.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="facts">
        <div><b>5 days</b><span>from roast to your door</span></div>
        <div><b>12</b><span>farms and co-ops we buy from</span></div>
        <div><b>100%</b><span>recyclable packaging</span></div>
    </div>
</section>
